Package: kmod-gl-mifi-mcu
Version: 5.4.154+1-1
Depends: kernel (=5.4.154-1-a615bf765d3202ede504c2b0d1198aa2)
Source: feeds/packages/utils/gl-mifi-mcu
SourceName: kmod-gl-mifi-mcu
License: GPL-3.0-or-later
Section: kernel
SourceDateEpoch: 1625478896
Maintainer: Nuno Goncalves <nunojpg@gmail.com>
Architecture: arm_cortex-a15_neon-vfpv4
Installed-Size: 2824
Filename: kmod-gl-mifi-mcu_5.4.154+1-1_arm_cortex-a15_neon-vfpv4.ipk
Size: 3845
SHA256sum: 4874c40a6cd1c1551650e1cb1cbed3322f3fc4ecd54f4f8193de4a00843085d1
Description:  Interfaces with GL-MiFI Power monitoring MCU with a soft UART
 and provides Battery SOC, Temperature and charging data at
 /proc/gl_mifi_mcu.
 This feature is supported from GL-MiFi PCB revision v2.6.2.
 The content of /proc/gl_mifi_mcu is JSON as received from the
 UART and will frequenty contain corrupted data due to soft UART
 unreliability. User application must validate the data.

